\"bead\": \"S13-B1\"},\n        {\"text\": \"还有希望\", \"bead\": \"S13-B1\"},\n        {\"text\": \"由私语转向开阔\", \"bead\": \"S13-B1\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"row\": 4,\n      \"items\": [\n        {\"text\": \"冲势慢下来\", \"bead\": \"S13-B3\"},\n        {\"text\": \"颤动的装饰音\", \"bead\": \"S13-B3\"},\n        {\"text\": \"真的稳了吗？\", \"bead\": \"S13-B3\"},\n        {\"text\": \"像一段话说完\", \"bead\": \"S13-B3\"},\n        {\"text\": \"终于能喘口气\", \"bead\": \"S13-B3\"},\n        {\"text\": \"从容下来\", \"bead\": \"S13-B3\"},\n        {\"text\": \"细微的不安\", \"bead\": \"S13-B3\"},\n        {\"text\": \"疑问还在\", \"bead\": \"S13-B3\"},\n        {\"text\": \"平静不等于放心\", \"bead\": \"S13-B3\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"row\": 6,\n      \"items\": [\n        {\"text\": \"像一个决定\", \"bead\": \"S13-B5\"},\n        {\"text\": \"心意终于定下\", \"bead\": \"S13-B5\"},\n        {\"text\": \"忽然从梦中醒来\", \"bead\": \"S13-B5\"},\n        {\"text\": \"一下清醒过来\", \"bead\": \"S13-B5\"}\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"lines\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"idx\": 0,\n      \"text\": \"想起从前的亲近，他心里满是感激。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"想起从前的亲近\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"idx\": 1,\n      \"text\": \"他不想忘掉那些开心的日子，也为离开他们而难受。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"开心的过去\", \"想到自己离开了他们\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"idx\": 1,\n      \"text\": \"他想再拥有这种默契，又怕再也遇不到；想到曾有过这份默契，心里暖了一点。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"遇到这样的默契\", \"自己曾拥有过\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"idx\": 1,\n      \"text\": \"他想找回从前的亲近，可想到回去还得受气，又问当初该不该走。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"想到还得受气\", \"早知道这样还会走吗\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"idx\": 0,\n      \"text\": \"他最难放下的，是那些无力再讲的往事。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"被当作自己人的日子\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"idx\": 1,\n      \"text\": \"他忘不掉难受的事，回去也未必像从前，越想越找不到答案。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"回去未必如旧\", \"越想越没答案\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"idx\": 0,\n      \"text\": \"那份亲近未必能找回，他心里却还留着一点盼头。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"明知回去未必找回那份亲近\", \"忍不住盼一盼\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"idx\": 1,\n      \"text\": \"他不因为怕孤单就回头，愿带着想念继续生活。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"不为怕孤单而回头\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"idx\": 0,\n      \"text\": \"想起从前那份自然的亲近，他心里又热了起来。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"从前自然亲近的日子\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "719432ba-9996-416d-99b5-1f67d1fbd277", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T185437103849Z", "elapsed_seconds": 963.218, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T19:10:40.343452+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64d73d77c3c37c2bb8e2c3f23630afa03d818a6bb7ef00f02383847c7527081f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence